OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen to batter Wales coast
OL,4,Awith 70mph winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravel disruption and damage to
OL,7,Fbuildings are expected when Storm
OL,8,FAusten, the first named storm of the
OL,9,Fautumn, hits south Wales later this
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FThe Met Office said the storm will
OL,13,Fbring a spell of strong winds up to
OL,14,F70mph (112km/h) overnight on Thursday
OL,15,Fand into Friday, mainly in coastal
OL,16,Fareas.
OL,18,FThe yellow warning for Wales was issued
OL,19,Fon Wednesday morning, with periods of
OL,20,Fheavy rain also expected. The Met
OL,21,FOffice said injuries and danger to life
OL,22,Ffrom flying debris are possible.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
