OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen to batter Wales coast
OL,4,Awith 70mph winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome roads and bridges may close, and
OL,7,Flonger journey times and cancellations
OL,8,Fto public transport are possible.
